<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="9c4bf28b">&lt;p&gt;
    Based on the information about expected benefits, defined measures, benefits realization plan, business case and other
    relevant data, fill out the benefits tracking tool. For each projected benefit indicate reference to the benefit in the
    benefits register, information about the benefit owner, planned metrics to measure benefit realization, key milestones
    and other data, which would support tracking of the benefit realization and variance analysis.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
